   1:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c **** /**
   2:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @file    stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c
   4:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
   5:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   * @brief   FLASH HAL module driver.
   6:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following 
   7:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   *          functionalities of the internal FLASH memory:
   8:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Program operations functions
   9:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Memory Control functions 
  10:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   *           + Peripheral State functions
  11:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   *         
  12:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   @verbatim
  13:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  14:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****                         ##### FLASH peripheral features #####
  15:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  16:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The Flash memory interface manages CPU AHB I-Code and D-Code accesses 
  17:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****        to the Flash memory. It implements the erase and program Flash memory operations 
  18:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****        and the read and write protection mechanisms.
  19:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  20:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The Flash memory interface accelerates code execution with a system of instruction
  21:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       prefetch. 
  22:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  23:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] The FLASH main features are:
  24:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Flash memory read operations
  25:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Flash memory program/erase operations
  26:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Read / write protections
  27:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Prefetch on I-Code
  28:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Option Bytes programming
  29:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  30:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c **** 
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccTtRKpd.s 			page 2


  31:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****                      ##### How to use this driver #####
  32:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   ==============================================================================
  33:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..]                             
  34:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       This driver provides functions and macros to configure and program the FLASH 
  35:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       memory of all STM32F3xx devices.
  36:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****     
  37:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) FLASH Memory I/O Programming functions: this group includes all needed
  38:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****           functions to erase and program the main memory:
  39:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Lock and Unlock the FLASH interface
  40:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Erase function: Erase page, erase all pages
  41:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Program functions: half word, word and doubleword
  42:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) FLASH Option Bytes Programming functions: this group includes all needed
  43:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****           functions to manage the Option Bytes:
  44:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Lock and Unlock the Option Bytes
  45:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Set/Reset the write protection
  46:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Set the Read protection Level
  47:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Program the user Option Bytes
  48:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Launch the Option Bytes loader
  49:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Erase Option Bytes
  50:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Program the data Option Bytes
  51:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Get the Write protection.
  52:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Get the user option bytes.
  53:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****     
  54:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (#) Interrupts and flags management functions : this group 
  55:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****           includes all needed functions to:
  56:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Handle FLASH interrupts
  57:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Wait for last FLASH operation according to its status
  58:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****         (++) Get error flag status
  59:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c **** 
  60:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   [..] In addition to these function, this driver includes a set of macros allowing
  61:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****        to handle the following operations:
  62:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       
  63:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Set/Get the latency
  64:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Enable/Disable the prefetch buffer
  65:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Enable/Disable the half cycle access
  66:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Enable/Disable the FLASH interrupts
  67:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****       (+) Monitor the FLASH flags status
  68:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****           
  69:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_flash.c ****   @endverbatim
